  "conclusion": "Positive Z bounded by 1; equality of r with the volume tilt and the explicit Gaussian density measure; r probability; pointwise q>0 and f2=q; integral q dgamma=1; C2 f; L2 f and grad f under gamma; L2 grad rho under r; integrability q log q under gamma; the two pointwise gradient identities; exact energy equality with factor 1/4.",
